 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 18842305, "name": "西瓜草莓冰淇淋", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLAmNMB07WVOSJ1C61KDhgZWz4cic5l5LnaHCnJ2hfwGE4XDibzC8Pp2pl80ibwWIic10RzfReOcH6ArOw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "西瓜草莓冰淇淋", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 3}]}, {"range": "25276-25286", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "223635575_8bRlDWPBn", "review": {"abstract": "日本产业资金供给状况", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 7, "content": "资金供给增长与经济增长并不是正相关关系。虽然货币供给一直在增长，但1971年之后经济增长率已经下了一个台阶，同时债券增长大大超过了股市市值增长。什么问题？布雷顿森林体系解体，印钞时代开启。经济增长率靠债务拉动，资金效率降低了。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "25276-25286", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "223635575_8bRlDWPBn", "userVid": 223635575, "topics": [], "createTime": 1788488847, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}}]}, {"range": "25563-25568", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "76670851_833aSrRVg", "review": {"abstract": "店头市场。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "是不是有点像美国早期的对赌行", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "25563-25568", "createTime": 1757466055, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "76670851_833aSrRVg", "userVid": 76670851, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 76670851, "name": "xiaoleLL", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELTN1n9ZtaWaW1x7er1cOf1IKjBDiaajkyPHTGZv8BekMnq6bIG5ZOzQ30Onr07VLabiaJOBG5KjLmlqTt9tibiaZ0ticqXohRWE3QP58Iu87jeAmQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}}}, {"reviewId": "3588999_7X7Ax5kuf", "review": {"abstract": "店头市场。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 838181438, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "店头市场，又称柜台市场或场外市场，是证券交易的一种形式，主要在证券交易所之外进行。\n\n特点\n\n- 地点: 店头市场没有固定的交易场所，通常在证券商的营业点内进行。\n\n- 交易方式: 买卖双方通过电话、电报或计算机网络进行交易，主要采用当面议价的方式。\n\n- 交易对象: 主要包括未在证券交易所上市的股票，此外还有各种债券等。\n\n- 交易价格: 由交易双方协商决定，而不是通过集中竞价的方式确定。\n\n参与者\n\n- 证券商: 在店头市场中，证券商通常同时具有自营商和经纪商的双重身份，负责提供交易服务并维持市场秩序。\n\n- 客户: 通常是个人投资者或机构投资者，他们通过证券商的柜台进行证券买卖。\n\n作用\n\n- 流动性提供: 店头市场为那些未能在证券交易所上市的证券提供了流动性，使投资者能够买卖这些证券。\n\n- 价格发现: 通过场外交易，证券的价格能够根据市场供求关系进行协商确定，有助于发现证券的真实价值。\n\n- 融资渠道: 对于一些小型公司而言，店头市场提供了一个相对灵活的融资渠道，能够满足其资金需求。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "25563-25568", "createTime": 1736587073, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3588999_7X7Ax5kuf", "userVid": 3588999, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 3588999, "name": "Li", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0016-ev0Mf7zIlKLpAgJh_IWiXca/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Li", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-5000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 5000}}}, "likesCount": 4}]}, {"range": "25699-25722", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 4, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "253631353_89YTVu4TI", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "从1958年到1961年7月，日经指数从约471点飙升至1829点的高位。市场极度狂热。为抑制过热，日本央行从1961年下半年开始实施金融紧缩政策（提高利率等）。高杠杆的股市对资金成本极其敏感，泡沫随之破裂。这个刹车引发了1962-1965年的经济衰退，工业生产下降、商品滞销，进一步恶化了上市公司的基本面。\n\n这个刹车同时暴露出当时证券行业的不成熟问题，比如\n\n市场结构问题：当时的证券公司通过控制的投资信托（基金） 大量承接自己承销的股票，风险高度集中且缺乏独立性，积累了巨大隐患。股市暴跌后，基金净值大跌，引发投资者恐慌性赎回，形成“下跌-赎回-抛售-再下跌”的恶性循环，基金业几乎崩溃。\n\n金融机构倒闭危机：1965年，日本第四大券商山一证券因经营恶化濒临破产，严重冲击整个金融体系的信用。\n\n后来推动制度的改革：基金公司要脱离证券公司控制、加强风险管理。\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "25699-25722", "abstract": "1961年的证券萧条迫使政府实施一系列救治措施", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "253631353_89YTVu4TI", "userVid": 253631353, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781874627, "userEditTime": 1781874819, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 253631353, "name": "Cliffia", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJkTVHyxjIbgOzicpFR8j6PosABia6TyH0MF3fMKOvYXiaJRLqTwkYqyErAceRIicU0uEHI3Xtonnp1oEWbGo22BO6aWPym56r8sKHSHfibjExMUrQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "200366530_87pnbz7wu", "review": {"abstract": "证券", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "zhènɡ quàn\n\n以证明或设定权利为目的所作成的凭证。有表示商品所有权的证券，如提单等；有表示财产所有权、收益请求权或债权的证券，如股票、无限股东出资证、公债券等。", "contextAbstract": "0年。1961年的证券萧条迫使政府实施一系", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "25705-25707", "createTime": 1772813395, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "200366530_87pnbz7wu", "userVid": 200366530, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "h