title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "447537194_8auiQY4no", "userVid": 447537194, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 447537194, "name": "冰果果🍧🍨", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/OO4hxIIN2cV9OInRdyjDMxl2eJWCJ2xhTZcdHBAIiaOJBBTbtVMVJlyUqyuDricsFso9vXTSvRofk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}}}, {"reviewId": "4891986_80U92Kuod", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "前两年我们也这么搞，现在流动性好了又开始发新股和增发了", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "25840-25917", "abstract": "最终政府不得不出面，实施一系列整改救治措施，包括停止新股上市和增发、配股，给证券公司提供流动性支持，成立托市基金等，这些为证券市场走向更大的繁荣创造了机会", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "4891986_80U92Kuod", "userVid": 4891986, "topics": [], "createTime": 1749909944, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 4891986, "name": "威涯", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/6M43hyknOsibria5rxxEqlicfoPYCSNXJoTdjlSBgfyhMWoQYj1ERqFAeq3Kicoico3Kgr7lpSDeyuQO4opZbNt2j0iaiaSok0Nl4DMgAZmxmBPyXk/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "威涯", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "站在巨人的肩膀上", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-500", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 500}}}, "likesCount": 14}, {"reviewId": "59807646_8813ikynN", "review": {"abstract": "给证券公司提供流动性支持", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "给证券公司提供流动性支持，指的是当证券公司因市场暴跌、资金被套牢或客户赎回等原因出现短期资金周转困难时，由中央银行或政府通过贷款、再贴现、担保融资等方式，向其注入现金或高流动性资产，帮助其维持正常运营和支付能力的救助行为。\n\n简单理解就是：在市场恐慌时，官方给券商“输血”，防止它们因为没钱而倒闭或被迫贱卖资产。\n\n它的主要作用有三点：\n\n防止券商倒闭和系统性风险扩散\n\n券商是市场的中介和稳定器，一旦大规模倒闭，会引发连锁反应：\n\n投资者资金无法兑付\n\n市场交易瘫痪\n\n流动性支持能避免这种情况发生，起到“防火墙”作用。\n\n缓解市场抛压，有助于稳定股价\n\n没有流动性支持的券商，为了自救往往会被迫大量抛售股票回笼资金，进一步打压股价。\n\n有了官方资金支持，券商不必急于抛售，从而减轻市场下跌压力，有利于止跌企稳。\n\n恢复市场信心，为后续复苏创造条件\n\n政府出手“兜底”，本身就是一种强烈信号：\n\n告诉投资者“市场不会无序崩盘”\n\n让机构敢于重新参与交易\n\n这有助于市场从恐慌中走出来，为之后成立托市基金、恢复新股发行等政策打下基础。\n\n结合你提到的日本1961年情况，这一措施的核心目标就是：先保住市场主体（券商）不死，再通过后续政策逐步修复市场功能。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "25877-25889", "createTime": 1774953581, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "59807646_8813ikynN", "userVid": 59807646, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 59807646, "name": "月上", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-eefKSt39uipBaGsPH65N8d5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "月上", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": 